  "short_description": "一款支持3–6名玩家的拍賣遊戲，圍繞虛張聲勢、欺騙與操控展開。你必須在緊張激烈的競價戰中智勝對手，隱藏真相，並將高風險交易轉化為利潤。每一輪都是心理博弈的較量，信任脆弱，策略決定勝負。",
  "short_description_en": "A 3–6 player auction game built around bluffing, deception, and manipulation, where you must outsmart your opponents in tense bidding wars, hide the truth, and turn risky trades into profit. Every round is a battle of mind games where trust is fragile and strategy decides the winner.",
